  "prefLabel": "Pol 101.10 County corrections officer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 101.10 \"County corrections officer\" means an officer of a county department of corrections whose primary duty is the custody of prisoners at a county correctional institution and who is eligible to become a member of the group II retirement system.\n\nSource. #1534, eff 2-17-80; ss by #1988, eff 3-25-82; ss by #2783, eff 7-27-84; ss by #4437, eff 6-22-88; ss by #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7301, eff 6-8-00",
